	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14_sign2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おとくな　けいじばん！▼

パソコンの　ボックスは
さいだい　２４こまで　ふえます！▼
つまり　７２０ひき
あずけることが　できます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T05:26:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>お得な　掲示板！▼

パソコンの　ボックスは
最大　２４個まで　増えます！▼
つまり　７２０匹
預けることが　できます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T05:26:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>看板：お得な掲示板</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
